title: Remove deprecated sp_maybe_compressed_blob::compress
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    This is part of #11561. `sp_maybe_compressed_blob::compress` was due for removal after June 2026, and it only forwarded to the same level-3 compression as `compress_weakly`. In-repo callers already use `compress_weakly` or `compress_strongly`. The private `compress_with_level` helper stays in place.
crates:
- name: sp-maybe-compressed-blob
  bump: major
